      "widgets_values": [
        "A tight close-up portrait captures a person with striking blue skin and piercing red irises that create an intense focal point. Thick, glossy black liquid drips from the forehead in symmetrical arcs, resembling viscous tar or heavy syrup, while similar dark streaks cascade down from her lower lash line like melancholic tears. Her lips are coated in a high-shine obsidian pigment that catches sharp specular highlights, with small droplets escaping toward her chin to add texture and weight. The skin features a subtle, fine grain under the blue pigmentation, revealing natural pores and slight imperfections around the nose and cheekbones. Deep red irises contrast sharply against the cool cerulean tones of the face, framed by long, dark eyelashes that are clumped with moisture. Lighting is primarily frontal but highly directional, creating high-contrast highlights on the bridge of the nose and forehead while casting soft shadows under the chin and within the eye sockets. The composition follows a strict vertical symmetry, centering her gaze directly into the lens to establish an immediate visual hierarchy between the eyes and the mouth. A shallow depth of field keeps the facial features in razor-sharp focus while allowing the dark hair at the periphery to recede into deep shadow. This macro perspective emphasizes every liquid droplet's surface tension against the matte blue complexion, creating a surrealist aesthetic through heavy color contrast and dramatic chiaroscuro effects.",
